<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολογ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>giving account, statement
				of reasons,</i> etc., v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.247
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.11.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>account kept, record,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολογισμὸν ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Klio</u>
					18.276
				</span></i>
			 (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				297.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.822e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>narration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.21.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολογία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ βίου, τῶν πράξεων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.726b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sull.</u>
				34
			</span></i>.</div>
